{"1469220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cat Simulator: Meow", "steam_appid": 1469220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your life is tired, just be a cat, become a cute and happy cat, and run freely in the beautiful open world!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a variety of different cats to play game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build freely, even a house and a cat sofa.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow various crops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing system – You are a cat that knows how to fish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pet system – tame and ride animals by defeating them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple animal enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft various fun items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast and magnificent open world to explore freely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic weather and day/night cycle system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AAA-level cat models and animations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic cat movement system, including a swimming system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich game modes, including survival mode and endless runner mode.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your life is tired, just be a cat, become a cute and happy cat, and run freely in the beautiful open world!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a variety of different cats to play game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build freely, even a house and a cat sofa.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow various crops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing system – You are a cat that knows how to fish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pet system – tame and ride animals by defeating them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple animal enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft various fun items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast and magnificent open world to explore freely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic weather and day/night cycle system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AAA-level cat models and animations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic cat movement system, including a swimming system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich game modes, including survival mode and endless runner mode.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "To be a cat, to be a free cat.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Danish, Ukrainian, Russian, Hungarian, Turkish, Greek, Norwegian, Czech, Japanese, Polish, Swedish, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Finnish, Dutch, Portuguese - Brazil, Korean, Bulgarian, Indonesian, Romanian, Portuguese - Portugal, Spanish - Latin America, Vietnamese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1469220/43a241e0459b99a0eecd51eb009f73e72cf6ce1f/header.jpg?t=1780932176", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1469220/1a5c0df11615c8281bb2310a784c0a8bd3bb4471/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780932176", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1469220/1a5c0df11615c8281bb2310a784c0a8bd3bb4471/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780932176", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> win10 / win11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3.2 GHz Dual Core Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 660 or equivalent with 2 GB of video RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li